t(20, 2065, """Marx's pit .. hundreds of millions of people fall into it daily .. I see .. my mind sees .. I classify .. I describe .. I set the law of the idea and I decide that it is correct! Then nothing .. death and absence, and the idea of those who were attacked remained alive and spread!""")

