t(33, 270, """Whenever tools dominate the movement of the mind, life is corrupted, and whenever history dominates the movement of the mind, the conditions of humanity improve.""")

h(33, 700, """The mind never changes; its view of the tools of life (phone - car) changes, but not of the constants and history!""")

t(33, 1290, """Some brothers read words whose meaning they do not know, and it is not possible for me to explain them, and the solution is easy. On the Google page on your phone, below the Search box, you will find the phrase AI Mode; press it and it will take you to the page for asking questions. Ask your question about anything at all, and the answer will appear for you in one second or 3 seconds.""")

t(33, 2300, """The day the whole Ummah comes to you as a delegation""")

h(34, 250, """O people of Palestine, it will be said to you: We have alighted in your land, so will you allow us to be your neighbours in it?""")

h(34, 1000, """O you who stay awake here: what has thrown you into worry and dressed you in the garment of earnestness, so that you have forsaken every herd? Could you not say: How sweet is sleep and its people? Or has the love of Allah made you weep for others!""")

t(34, 1590, """And no title""")

h(34, 1900, """When al-Anushtakin and al-Numairi are put in chains, new cities will be built that will have no name!""")

t(34, 2500, """O history lying in your grave, where your face was blackened .. your army turned back .. your glory was scattered over the soil, and your night grew heavy upon you: we shall cross, by the leave of Allah.""")
